  "scope": "Read entire proposed EqCtx source and audit, plus actual Quantifier finite-vacuity and projection interfaces; no Lean/compiler/checker/version/dependency calls, no maintained edits, and no claims of elaboration or execution. This is independent source review; a separate vacuity extension is authored by this reviewer.",
